{"id":25604,"author":"AbusiveUser","body":"\u003cimg src=\"http://i.imgur.com/TvPZLC8.png\" title=\"Image: http://i.imgur.com/TvPZLC8.png\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ci style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/i\u003eHello everybody! today, I'm gonna present to you a remake of my map called \"Valley Of Wood\", now called as Monthand. I remade a lot of things in this map, I changed the the floor to Stone Bricks and fixed a lot of stuff, so I wanted to make a new thread and don't bump the last one.\u003cbr\u003eI created this map with my lovely friend iScaglia, but I decided to made the remake alone (sorry for that buddy) so I hope you like this map as much as I did.\u003ci style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eWhen we created the original map, we tried to create a map where you can make many strategies as you want! and also, we think the layout of the map is pretty good to have a good match, so enjoy!\u003c/span\u003e\u003ci style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e------------------\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eOriginal Creators:\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;AbusiveUser \u0026amp; iScaglia\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eServer hosted by:\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;ShinyDialga \u0026amp; Avicus Build Server\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eGamemode:\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;5CP (Atlas Update)\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eIt features 5 points in total to capture, with spawns getting closer to the enemy team as you capture the points.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eRecommended Size:\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e8v8 for a Tournament\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eBuilding time: \u003c/b\u003e1\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;day\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eOriginal Feedback:\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;Tomqss and Claf\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial